Package: hashrat
Version: 1.25
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: build-essential, make, openssl, zlib, findutils
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ColumPaget/Hashrat
Description: Cryptographics hash-generation command-line utility
 Hashrat supports md5, sha1, sha256, sha512, whirlpool, jh and
 hmac versions of these hashes. It includes recursive file hashing,
 directory tree hashing, and output in several formats including
 plain text, JSON, and CSV.
